  "additional_corrections": {
    "experience": [
      "During the current three deliveries,",
      "Selected Subject → Domain Lens → Scope / Permission",
      "Start from a Subject; read its commercial signals, event stream, cases, risk, decisions, actions, schedules and reports; trace each decision to source and follow-up outcome",
      "Start from Brand/Market focus; connect category movement, competitors, audience, creators, content, channels, campaigns, brand risk and evaluation",
      "Select authorized Subject → inspect current and historical signals → open source evidence → create/assign a case or decision → confirm authorized result → revisit measured outcome → Return to the same Subject context",
      "Reject a screen proposal that merges or changes these starts.",
      "Two-stage chooser: authorized Subject list first, then CTH or BMP lens; subject identity and lens are visually separate so selecting a view cannot imply changing ownership.",
      "Search/select an authorized Subject, then confirm an available lens; server response controls the destination.",
      "Subject-anchored operating desk: metric spine, chronological signal ribbon, event/evidence focus and a decision/action queue.",
      "State a task, confirm authorized context, inspect evidence/capability plan and start only when an executable route exists.",
      "Source-to-artifact canvas: brief and evidence rail, editable creation canvas, version/outcome lane; different from campaign planning and podcast editing.",
      "Create a draft from a real brief, cite evidence, review revisions and hand off for human approval."
    ],
    "owner": "Existing Metric/domain/API compatibility mapping; legacy callable still requires repair"
  },
